## Revenue Model

**Commission Structure**: {commission_rate}% per transaction

### 3-Year Revenue Projections

| Year | Transactions | Avg Transaction | Commission Rate | Gross Revenue | Platform Costs | Net Revenue |
|------|-------------|----------------|-----------------|---------------|----------------|-------------|
| Year 1 | {y1_transactions} | ${y1_avg_transaction} | {commission_rate}% | ${y1_gross_revenue} | ${y1_costs} | ${y1_net_revenue} |
| Year 2 | {y2_transactions} | ${y2_avg_transaction} | {commission_rate}% | ${y2_gross_revenue} | ${y2_costs} | ${y2_net_revenue} |
| Year 3 | {y3_transactions} | ${y3_avg_transaction} | {commission_rate}% | ${y3_gross_revenue} | ${y3_costs} | ${y3_net_revenue} |

### Cost Structure

#### Fixed Costs (Annual)
- Platform Development & Maintenance: ${platform_costs}
- Marketing & Customer Acquisition: ${marketing_costs}
- Personnel (Team of {team_size}): ${personnel_costs}
- Legal, Insurance & Admin: ${admin_costs}
- **Total Fixed Costs**: ${total_fixed_costs}

#### Variable Costs (Per Transaction)
- Payment Processing (2.9% + $0.30): ${payment_processing}
- Customer Support: ${support_cost}
- Transaction Insurance: ${insurance_cost}
- **Total Variable Cost**: ${variable_cost_per_transaction}

### Financial Metrics

| Metric | Year 1 | Year 2 | Year 3 | Industry Benchmark |
|--------|--------|--------|--------|--------------------|
| Gross Margin | {y1_gross_margin}% | {y2_gross_margin}% | {y3_gross_margin}% | 70-85% |
| EBITDA Margin | {y1_ebitda_margin}% | {y2_ebitda_margin}% | {y3_ebitda_margin}% | 10-30% |
| CAC (Customer Acquisition Cost) | ${y1_cac} | ${y2_cac} | ${y3_cac} | ${cac_benchmark} |
| LTV (Lifetime Value) | ${y1_ltv} | ${y2_ltv} | ${y3_ltv} | ${ltv_benchmark} |
| LTV:CAC Ratio | {y1_ltv_cac}:1 | {y2_ltv_cac}:1 | {y3_ltv_cac}:1 | 3:1 (minimum) |
| Break-Even Point | Month {breakeven_month} | - | - | 18-24 months |

### Cash Flow Projections

**Year 1**:
- Operating Cash Flow: ${y1_operating_cashflow}
- Capex: ${y1_capex}
- Net Cash Flow: ${y1_net_cashflow}

**Year 2**:
- Operating Cash Flow: ${y2_operating_cashflow}
- Capex: ${y2_capex}
- Net Cash Flow: ${y2_net_cashflow}

**Year 3**:
- Operating Cash Flow: ${y3_operating_cashflow}
- Capex: ${y3_capex}
- Net Cash Flow: ${y3_net_cashflow}

**Cumulative Cash Flow**: ${cumulative_cashflow}

### Funding Requirements

- **Seed Round**: ${seed_amount} (runway: {seed_runway} months)
- **Use of Funds**:
  - Product Development: {product_percent}%
  - Marketing & Growth: {marketing_percent}%
  - Operations & Admin: {operations_percent}%
  - Reserve: {reserve_percent}%

### Key Financial Assumptions

1. Transaction growth: {transaction_growth_y1}% (Y1), {transaction_growth_y2}% (Y2), {transaction_growth_y3}% (Y3)
2. Average transaction value growth: {atv_growth}% annually (inflation + premium tier adoption)
3. Customer retention: {retention_rate}% annually
4. Churn rate: {churn_rate}% monthly
5. Platform take rate remains constant at {commission_rate}%
6. Payment processing fees: 2.9% + $0.30 per transaction
7. Marketing CAC improves by {cac_improvement}% annually through referrals and organic growth
